+++ b/frontend/vendor/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,31 @@
+# Runfold Event packages
+
+These tarballs are reproducible frontend dependencies for the local Nexent
+Event trajectory experiment. They are consumed directly by `package.json`;
+the DSH-derived Trajectory UI is not copied or rewritten in this repository.
+The `pnpm.overrides` entry resolves the UI package's exact SDK dependency to
+the checked-in SDK tarball instead of the unpublished public npm package.
+
+Source project: `Runfold`
+
+Source revision: `d79ae96`
+
+| File | Package | SHA-256 |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `runfold-event-0.1.0.tgz` | `@runfold/event@0.1.0` | `8fb83f99ab884c429e6d6d8207fb3a056981c57f92f7bcafa2277ed6a3cd7f28` |
+| `runfold-trajectory-ui-0.1.0.tgz` | `@runfold/trajectory-ui@0.1.0` | `dc48628a770b5edfde3f6eca0156def90d069372f2efbeaec059d434e3580eb1` |
+
+The packages were produced from the source revision above with:
+
+```bash
+npm run build --workspace @runfold/event
+npm run build --workspace @runfold/trajectory-ui
+npm pack --workspace @runfold/event
+npm pack --workspace @runfold/trajectory-ui
+```
+
+Verify the checked-in artifacts before installation:
+
+```bash
+shasum -a 256 -c vendor/SHA256SUMS
+```
